<title>USA: Baraboo, Wis., won by Banc One.</title>
<headline>Baraboo, Wis., won by Banc One.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Capital Corporation said it won $1.455 million of Baraboo, Wis., general obligation University Center improvement bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.04 percent.</p>
